Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.99,0:01:03.57,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,噢噢
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.37,0:01:30.34,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,完成啦 哈哈哈哈
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.05,0:01:32.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯？
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.14,0:01:35.39,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是谁
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.47,0:01:59.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这个装置是什么
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.66,0:02:00.68,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,涅茧利大人
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.54,0:02:05.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,请问您怎么了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.57,0:02:06.81,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你是谁
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.00,0:02:07.95,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,涅茧利大人？
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.13,0:02:11.67,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你别过来 你要来抓我吗 哼
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.94,0:02:12.73,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,啊
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.90,0:02:20.03,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,请问…
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.02,0:02:25.42,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,别过来！别过来！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.49,0:02:36.62,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,涅茧利大人 您干什么
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.79,0:02:37.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,松手
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.60,0:02:38.59,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,啊
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.14,0:02:49.19,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在技术开发局第七研究塔内确认异常灵压
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.50,0:02:53.01,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有人正在实验楼顶层进行破坏活动
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.38,0:02:56.76,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,超高浓度的灵子云正在向附近扩散
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.31,0:02:58.46,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,重复说明
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.65,0:03:01.54,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,请护庭十三队全队及鬼道众增援
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.70,0:03:02.49,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这是…
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.67,0:03:03.57,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,啊…
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.93,0:03:10.14,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哇哇！那是什么 哇哇！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.56,0:03:17.52,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快撤
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.69,0:03:19.42,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那到底什么东西啊
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.64,0:03:21.84,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快走
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.67,0:03:26.65,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哈 什么
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.16,0:03:33.02,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,涅队长 请您住手吧
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.17,0:03:37.81,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,别接近我 你们想把我怎么样
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.14,0:03:40.76,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,喂
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.93,0:03:41.96,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哇！哇！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.65,0:03:50.35,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你怎么了 终于变神经病了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.40,0:03:59.74,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.86,0:04:23.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什么啊
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.03,0:04:34.86,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,切 真碍事
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.41,0:05:09.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,发生什么了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.96,0:05:11.89,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不行 不能去
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.06,0:05:13.19,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.74,0:05:16.88,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是谁
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.35,0:05:28.56,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哈哈哈  哈哈哈哈哈
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.85,0:05:36.78,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我要消除你的存在
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.75,0:05:53.36,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,静灵庭被…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.08,0:05:56.88,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快往高处跑
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.09,0:06:13.32,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真活该
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.51,0:06:15.99,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,死神什么的全灭绝了才好呢
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.53,0:06:18.73,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们总是在失去
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.22,0:06:21.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,而他们总是在夺取
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.57,0:06:45.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,《呼唤君之名》
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.87,0:07:02.74,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯？刚才的是什么
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.35,0:07:07.22,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,从刚才开始你一直都在干什么呢
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.52,0:07:10.21,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,只是在看大姐留下的信啊
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.47,0:07:12.96,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,用暗号写的哪能看懂嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.66,0:07:14.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,啊？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.28,0:07:19.15,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不要买…用壳…木…和…
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.69,0:07:21.62,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这个画是暗示？这什么玩意儿
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.80,0:07:24.25,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,啊啊！嗯…
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.81,0:07:28.25,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不许抱怨大姐艺术般的画
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.47,0:07:29.51,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真无聊
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.80,0:07:32.18,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,还有 那个大姐到底是谁啊
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.39,0:07:35.07,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哈？大姐就是大姐嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.27,0:07:37.71,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你说什么呢 傻了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.17,0:07:39.97,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,傻了的是你吧
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.51,0:07:42.03,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,啊啊 累死了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.21,0:07:43.49,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,今天就睡了哈
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.74,0:07:45.97,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,喂 你好好听我我说话啊
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.14,0:07:47.97,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你… 啊啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.96,0:08:04.79,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一护
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.78,0:08:09.24,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,走吧 一护
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.33,0:08:12.59,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,笨蛋
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.75,0:08:16.13,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,傻瓜
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.62,0:08:20.63,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我才不会说谢谢呢
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.46,0:08:27.67,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你要成为死神的
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.59,0:08:35.02,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,露琪亚…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.49,0:08:37.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,喂 魂
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.13,0:08:39.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快起来
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.68,0:08:41.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,干嘛呀 突然间…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.40,0:08:42.82,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哇 啊…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.09,0:08:47.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这个像蟑螂的画…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.00,0:08:50.06,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,旁边画着西瓜 也就是说…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.27,0:08:51.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是想说独角仙吗
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.01,0:08:53.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,也就是说…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.62,0:08:55.47,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,因为有急事
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.73,0:08:57.52,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,所以要回尸魂界
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.88,0:08:59.18,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,几天后就回来
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.36,0:09:01.18,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,给我老老实实等着
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.42,0:09:02.64,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你这傻瓜
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.81,0:09:03.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,露琪亚
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.70,0:09:07.41,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,尸魂界…
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.12,0:09:15.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,请
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.25,0:09:18.21,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不好意思啊 小雨
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.77,0:09:20.01,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,啊…
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.87,0:09:27.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那 你…
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.10,0:09:29.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这个…那个…
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.13,0:09:31.05,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,朽木露琪亚
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.22,0:09:32.81,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,啊 朽木露琪亚？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.37,0:09:35.48,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那是谁呀
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.65,0:09:37.88,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你说什么呢 是露琪亚啊
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.11,0:09:40.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不是你这的常客吗
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.43,0:09:43.38,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,常客吗…
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.85,0:09:48.69,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,啊 名字的确是有…
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.86,0:09:49.37,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对吧
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.53,0:09:51.29,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但是真的不好意思
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.45,0:09:53.18,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我的确不知道
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.02,0:09:56.08,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,到底怎么回事
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.25,0:09:57.41,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这个嘛…
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.63,0:10:00.54,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,话说你不也有一瞬间把大姐给忘了嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.28,0:10:04.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,露琪亚发生了什么吗
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.54,0:10:05.44,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那个…
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.61,0:10:08.32,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,虽然不知道和那个露琪亚有没有关系
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.76,0:10:12.19,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,其实昨晚在静灵庭发生了难以置信的事件
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.37,0:10:12.94,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,事件？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.07,0:10:13.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是啊
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.11,0:10:17.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,十二番队队长涅茧利精神错乱
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.44,0:10:18.71,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,破坏了设施
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.89,0:10:23.37,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,静灵庭的三分之一都被彻底破坏了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.61,0:10:24.61,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.78,0:10:27.67,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如果这两个事件之间有什么联系的话
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.07,0:10:33.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,也就是意味着我们的记忆错乱是有原因的吧
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.45,0:10:39.15,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,请问 你和露琪亚小姐是什么关系啊？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.36,0:10:40.21,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那种事…
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.01,0:10:45.44,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是非常重要的朋友
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.70,0:10:48.51,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是我最亲爱的大姐
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.78,0:10:49.46,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,走吧 一护
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.61,0:10:51.64,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,去尸魂界 出发吧
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.65,0:10:55.36,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,浦原先生 请使用穿界门吧
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.16,0:10:57.61,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那样子啊
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.09,0:11:13.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,异常灵子的流出已经被控制住了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.69,0:11:16.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,护庭十三队各队
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.70,0:11:20.79,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,为了探明原因已在庭内展开调查
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.48,0:11:40.55,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可恶！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.74,0:11:42.04,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.60,0:11:47.37,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真是的 嗯？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.95,0:11:52.49,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哇哇 一护 糟糕了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.67,0:11:55.89,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快看这个
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.92,0:12:00.81,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这开什么玩笑啊
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.26,0:12:02.92,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这根本不是什么玩笑
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.51,0:12:05.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不会是全军覆没吧
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.84,0:12:07.53,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,队长等人应该还好
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.73,0:12:08.37,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,其他人就…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.55,0:12:12.02,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大姐呢 大姐还好吧 呐
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.23,0:12:13.99,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,烦人  别闹了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.21,0:12:16.08,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不管怎么样先找露琪亚吧
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.42,0:12:19.37,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,啊
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.66,0:12:31.47,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,门关着的呢
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.84,0:12:33.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真是些碍事的家伙
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.42,0:12:40.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那是
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.58,0:12:41.64,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,认识吗
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.84,0:12:43.22,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,脸还是认识的
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.02,0:12:45.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,桧佐木
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.17,0:12:45.98,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.17,0:12:47.81,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,到底发生了什么
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.29,0:12:49.42,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,干吧
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.21,0:13:08.13,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哇
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.34,0:13:09.22,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那是什么
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.81,0:13:10.62,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,来了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.65,0:13:15.95,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,百步阑干
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.40,0:13:31.42,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什么
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.55,0:13:41.72,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,来了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.58,0:13:45.29,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,喂 你们别跑啊
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.99,0:14:10.26,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这是和露琪亚一起走过的
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.44,0:14:11.58,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,属于我们的路啊
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.77,0:14:12.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,走吧
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.30,0:14:16.62,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,喂 刚才的是什么呀
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.18,0:14:22.12,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,咦？ 大家都怎么了？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.42,0:14:26.18,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,啊 怎么啦
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.44,0:14:29.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那个假面 你到底是谁
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.47,0:14:33.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一护 不是认识的人吗 喂
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.91,0:14:36.77,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,桧佐木 是我 黑崎一护啊
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.27,0:14:38.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,抓住他们
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.18,0:14:38.97,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.22,0:14:41.67,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,喂喂 等等
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.82,0:14:52.88,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你这个旅祸
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.20,0:14:58.22,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,喂 一护
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.79,0:15:00.02,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,虽然不知道怎么回事
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.19,0:15:01.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不过不是很危险吗
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.44,0:15:04.88,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,桧佐木 我没打算…和你打！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.97,0:15:17.39,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你这个旅祸
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.17,0:15:20.38,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,阿散井 别让那小子跑了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.73,0:15:22.67,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,全都是你搞的鬼吗
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.12,0:15:25.54,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是我 一护啊
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.82,0:15:26.84,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不认识了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.04,0:15:28.76,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,说什么呢
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.40,0:15:31.78,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快住手 恋次
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.62,0:15:34.28,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不想和你打
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.65,0:15:37.98,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你小子 为何知道我的名字
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.91,0:15:41.01,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,听我说 恋次
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.26,0:15:42.47,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,露琪亚她有危险
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.01,0:15:44.18,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,露琪亚？
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.49,0:15:47.18,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你小子一直说什么呢
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.65,0:15:51.29,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,难道说…连露琪亚也忘了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.74,0:15:52.72,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是露琪亚啊
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.02,0:15:54.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,露琪亚？
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.91,0:16:02.63,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你不可能忘记的
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.84,0:16:04.06,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是吧 恋次！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.29,0:16:07.73,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,别跟我说这些胡话
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.04,0:16:09.15,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,恋次！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.12,0:16:11.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,到底怎么了啊
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.87,0:16:13.22,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我还想问呢
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.68,0:16:16.99,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,跟上阿散井！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.20,0:16:18.12,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.64,0:16:22.01,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那要怎么办啊
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.58,0:16:24.02,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,总之 这里先…
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.67,0:16:32.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你是…
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.96,0:16:35.09,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,别想逃！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.58,0:16:36.81,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,狛村
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.64,0:16:38.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,找到了！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.85,0:16:39.76,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可恶
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.07,0:16:41.32,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,给我抓紧了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.50,0:16:42.55,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.49,0:16:46.52,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你小子
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.55,0:16:50.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,卍解 黑绳天谴明王
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.19,0:16:55.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哇！这个大个的是什么啊
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.70,0:17:00.84,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,喂 要过来了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.56,0:17:06.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,月牙天冲
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.69,0:18:01.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这里是…
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.07,0:18:06.53,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,把我的水还回来 杀了你！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.53,0:18:11.56,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快点
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.68,0:18:16.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,戌吊…
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.01,0:18:22.15,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,露琪亚
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.12,0:18:27.22,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,喂 你干什么啊
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.57,0:18:28.77,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你是谁啊
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.79,0:18:37.67,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你…们是？
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.89,0:18:39.02,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,姐姐
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.48,0:18:41.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不让她好好地看看你的脸的话
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.61,0:18:42.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是想不起来的
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.01,0:18:45.68,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯 我知道…
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.70,0:18:53.57,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,看啊 露琪亚 看着我们
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.71,0:19:04.59,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快报告受损情况
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.03,0:19:07.07,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,流出的灵子造成的损害
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.30,0:19:09.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,以东西方向为中心二百灵厘…
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.25,0:19:13.09,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,波及了静灵庭内全境的三成
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.70,0:19:15.76,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,受伤的状况呢
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.23,0:19:18.03,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,第一次看见这种情况
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.40,0:19:22.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,被灵子缠绕 仿佛石化了一般
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.77,0:19:26.53,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,从现状看 就连是否活着都无法确认
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.20,0:19:28.34,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,涅呢？
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.00,0:19:32.38,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,看起来还无法确定
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.76,0:19:35.71,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,现状 还有就连自己也…
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.33,0:19:39.95,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,仿佛记忆的一部分消失了一样
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.57,0:19:42.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,狛村队长
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.57,0:19:47.77,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,和身份不明身着死霸装的旅祸交战一事…
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.92,0:19:51.57,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是 旅祸持有虚那样的假面
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.75,0:19:55.03,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我认为其灵压可以和队长级别相匹敌
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.26,0:19:56.47,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真的吗
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.74,0:19:57.64,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,千真万确
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.78,0:20:02.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,而且 不可思议的是 那家伙熟知我们的事情
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.88,0:20:06.03,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好像对朽木队长和阿散井副队长
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.20,0:20:09.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,还特意强调自己的名字并对话了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.92,0:20:11.32,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那件事的话…
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.63,0:20:16.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他交上来的报告上说是完全不认识的人
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.66,0:20:19.09,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真不爽
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.53,0:20:20.67,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.94,0:20:24.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对什么都是 我自己也是…
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.81,0:20:26.58,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真是窘境啊
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.97,0:20:30.69,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,给我把它当成静灵庭开辟以来的第一大事
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.96,0:20:34.86,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,各队联手 发现旅祸即刻捉拿
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.02,0:20:51.76,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,啊！抱歉 对不起
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.97,0:20:53.39,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,别杀我
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.60,0:20:54.39,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这里是？
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.56,0:20:55.59,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是下水道
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.79,0:20:57.72,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我只是在这里打扫
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.98,0:21:00.21,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,然后突然你就从天上掉下来了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.38,0:21:03.49,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你的治疗还是一样的棒啊
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.70,0:21:05.15,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哎？那个…
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.33,0:21:07.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你认识我吗
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.89,0:21:15.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,说来感觉好像之前也给你治疗过…
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.86,0:21:23.05,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对…对不起 是错觉吧
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.96,0:21:27.03,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,别让他瞎期待啊
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.85,0:21:31.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就是说
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.78,0:21:32.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯？
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.33,0:21:34.93,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你现在正在烦恼中吧
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.46,0:21:37.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这你怎么会知道
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.38,0:21:38.37,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我知道
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.56,0:21:40.94,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,所谓治疗 即“手掌” （日语中治疗为“手当”）
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.56,0:21:47.35,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.13,0:21:43.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就是可以用手掌去触摸那个人的心灵
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.04,0:21:47.35,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,所以伤口的疼痛和心的疼痛都能传达过来的
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.98,0:21:50.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就算在这儿发愁也没用啊
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.97,0:21:51.97,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,要走了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.54,0:21:53.31,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,啊
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.66,0:21:54.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.40,0:22:02.64,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,多谢照顾了 花太郎
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.90,0:22:04.39,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,啊 没事
Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.09,0:22:10.86,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,为什么知道我的名字…？
Dialogue: 0,0:22:16.27,0:22:17.36,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,来吧 露琪亚
Dialogue: 0,0:22:17.72,0:22:19.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,喝了就有劲了
Dialogue: 0,0:22:23.23,0:22:24.21,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎么样？
Dialogue: 0,0:22:24.42,0:22:25.38,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好喝
Dialogue: 0,0:22:25.74,0:22:27.28,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,太好了
Dialogue: 0,0:22:28.87,0:22:30.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,问一件事可以吗
Dialogue: 0,0:22:30.84,0:22:31.78,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:22:31.95,0:22:33.86,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我认识你们
Dialogue: 0,0:22:34.04,0:22:35.14,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但是 对不起
Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.30,0:22:37.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不能清楚的回想起来
Dialogue: 0,0:22:38.09,0:22:43.04,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:39.36,0:22:43.32,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这封信是我何时从你们那里收到的呢
Dialogue: 0,0:22:43.63,0:22:44.79,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,画的好吧
Dialogue: 0,0:22:45.00,0:22:48.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是照着露琪亚常给我们画的画画出来的哦
Dialogue: 0,0:22:49.50,0:22:51.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,感觉你一定会知道的
Dialogue: 0,0:22:52.76,0:22:54.76,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,为何没写名字？
Dialogue: 0,0:22:55.80,0:22:56.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,因为没有啊
Dialogue: 0,0:22:57.08,0:22:59.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哎？没有名字吗
Dialogue: 0,0:23:02.31,0:23:05.39,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但是露琪亚跟我们约定了要给我们起的
Dialogue: 0,0:23:05.54,0:23:06.67,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,约定…？
Dialogue: 0,0:23:06.89,0:23:08.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我给你们…？
Dialogue: 0,0:23:08.57,0:23:12.48,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯 在现世是父母给孩子起名字吧
Dialogue: 0,0:23:12.83,0:23:16.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,所以露琪亚说好了给我们起名字的
Dialogue: 0,0:23:17.43,0:23:19.42,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我来 起名…
Dialogue: 0,0:23:19.72,0:23:20.79,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:23:29.51,0:23:33.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真是的 干嘛弄成这么湿
Dialogue: 0,0:23:34.73,0:23:37.34,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,露琪亚 要跟我们说什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:23:37.57,0:23:38.39,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:23:38.57,0:23:42.53,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,啊 你们没有名字吧
Dialogue: 0,0:23:42.91,0:23:46.17,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如果可以的话 可以让我来起吗
Dialogue: 0,0:23:46.42,0:23:48.65,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没有名字的话 很多时候…
Dialogue: 0,0:23:50.64,0:23:53.02,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎么了 不喜欢的话不用勉强…
Dialogue: 0,0:23:53.21,0:23:54.31,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好开心
Dialogue: 0,0:23:55.11,0:23:58.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一直想让露琪亚起来着
Dialogue: 0,0:23:59.54,0:24:00.34,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,起吧
Dialogue: 0,0:24:00.52,0:24:01.39,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,拜托了
Dialogue: 0,0:24:01.61,0:24:02.77,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,起名吧
Dialogue: 0,0:24:03.00,0:24:04.55,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,其实已经想好了
Dialogue: 0,0:24:04.73,0:24:07.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哇 名字 名字！太好了
Dialogue: 0,0:24:07.87,0:24:10.31,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,喂喂 别这么大声啊
Dialogue: 0,0:24:10.70,0:24:11.94,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,露琪亚！
Dialogue: 0,0:24:12.64,0:24:15.38,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是啊 我那时…
Dialogue: 0,0:24:17.23,0:24:20.63,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们两个是那对小姐弟啊
Dialogue: 0,0:24:23.47,0:24:25.98,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们的名字是什么？露琪亚
Dialogue: 0,0:24:27.28,0:24:31.12,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我没告诉你们名字吗
Dialogue: 0,0:24:38.78,0:24:40.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,露琪亚 怎么了
Dialogue: 0,0:24:41.16,0:24:42.18,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没事吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:24:43.48,0:24:46.07,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,啊 没事
Dialogue: 0,0:24:46.61,0:24:49.81,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对不起 有点想不起来…
Dialogue: 0,0:24:50.79,0:24:51.99,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对不起
Dialogue: 0,0:24:52.92,0:24:55.28,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我到现在一直怎么了
Dialogue: 0,0:24:55.66,0:24:56.69,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那个…
Dialogue: 0,0:24:56.85,0:24:58.84,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一直昏睡着 露琪亚
Dialogue: 0,0:25:00.15,0:25:02.31,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,很长的时间 一直…
Dialogue: 0,0:25:02.71,0:25:03.97,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,昏睡…？
Dialogue: 0,0:25:04.50,0:25:07.74,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是啊 受了伤一直睡着
Dialogue: 0,0:25:08.20,0:25:13.54,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,所以别慌张 我们会一直在一起的
Dialogue: 0,0:25:30.72,0:25:33.28,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,您怎么了吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:25:33.53,0:25:34.88,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没什么
Dialogue: 0,0:26:15.09,0:26:17.49,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那张照片 是大姐的
Dialogue: 0,0:26:19.27,0:26:20.88,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,别大声嚷嚷
Dialogue: 0,0:26:21.08,0:26:23.46,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不好意思 擅自闯进来了
Dialogue: 0,0:26:24.05,0:26:26.58,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我也不想在这种地方引起骚动
Dialogue: 0,0:26:28.02,0:26:29.92,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那张照片 是绯真吧
Dialogue: 0,0:26:30.47,0:26:32.05,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真像露琪亚啊
Dialogue: 0,0:26:32.90,0:26:35.13,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你是不是也感觉到了什么
Dialogue: 0,0:26:35.84,0:26:37.13,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在说什么呢
Dialogue: 0,0:26:37.43,0:26:38.67,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,别装傻
Dialogue: 0,0:26:39.10,0:26:41.15,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,绯真是露琪亚的姐姐吧
Dialogue: 0,0:26:43.09,0:26:44.34,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,露琪亚…
Dialogue: 0,0:26:44.97,0:26:46.51,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是啊 露琪亚
Dialogue: 0,0:26:47.03,0:26:49.37,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,露琪亚是你的义妹吧
Dialogue: 0,0:26:50.17,0:26:53.85,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是你就算破了戒律也要保护的妹妹
Dialogue: 0,0:26:58.34,0:27:00.57,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,果然连你也不记得了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:27:05.18,0:27:06.33,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,卿…
Dialogue: 0,0:27:06.89,0:27:10.55,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,为何认识吾妻绯真
Dialogue: 0,0:27:10.95,0:27:12.07,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那是…
Dialogue: 0,0:27:14.16,0:27:15.21,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一护！
Dialogue: 0,0:27:20.05,0:27:21.28,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,别出手
Dialogue: 0,0:27:21.50,0:27:22.55,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,队长！
Dialogue: 0,0:27:24.15,0:27:26.86,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你小子！为何在这里！
Dialogue: 0,0:27:27.56,0:27:28.61,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,慢着 恋次
Dialogue: 0,0:27:28.89,0:27:29.88,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,别废话
Dialogue: 0,0:27:30.10,0:27:32.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,咆哮吧 蛇尾丸
Dialogue: 0,0:27:36.39,0:27:39.65,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我告诉你了你都不明白吗！
Dialogue: 0,0:27:40.15,0:27:41.21,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什么啊
Dialogue: 0,0:27:41.66,0:27:44.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那么就让你的身体来明白
Dialogue: 0,0:27:51.14,0:27:52.48,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,卍解！
Dialogue: 0,0:27:59.09,0:28:00.38,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎么了啊 恋次
Dialogue: 0,0:28:00.56,0:28:01.54,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可恶
Dialogue: 0,0:28:02.42,0:28:04.31,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你不卍解吗
Dialogue: 0,0:28:04.65,0:28:06.63,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我 卍解？
Dialogue: 0,0:28:07.47,0:28:09.88,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不是为了救露琪亚修行过了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:28:10.28,0:28:11.22,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,鬼知道
Dialogue: 0,0:28:11.40,0:28:13.34,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,咆哮吧 蛇尾丸
Dialogue: 0,0:28:18.36,0:28:19.86,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快给我想起来啊
Dialogue: 0,0:28:21.90,0:28:25.24,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你想让我想起什么来啊
Dialogue: 0,0:28:26.43,0:28:28.76,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,别给我得意忘形
Dialogue: 0,0:28:40.58,0:28:41.62,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,散落吧
Dialogue: 0,0:28:51.20,0:28:57.18,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,绯真出生在南流魂街78区 戌吊
Dialogue: 0,0:28:57.76,0:28:59.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对不起
Dialogue: 0,0:29:13.99,0:29:15.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,露琪亚
Dialogue: 0,0:29:17.10,0:29:19.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,上你那边…可以吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:29:20.27,0:29:21.25,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,啊
Dialogue: 0,0:29:25.74,0:29:28.19,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,露琪亚 你怎么了
Dialogue: 0,0:29:29.00,0:29:32.78,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,感觉好久没吸过这城里的空气了
Dialogue: 0,0:29:33.13,0:29:35.22,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真是不能安心啊
Dialogue: 0,0:29:35.77,0:29:38.07,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不知道自己的事情
Dialogue: 0,0:29:38.42,0:29:39.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,露琪亚…
Dialogue: 0,0:29:41.12,0:29:44.55,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们一直在等着吧
Dialogue: 0,0:29:45.46,0:29:48.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,等我那时说是要起的名字…
Dialogue: 0,0:29:53.18,0:29:56.22,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我一定会想起来的 那个名字
Dialogue: 0,0:29:57.24,0:29:58.38,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:30:02.78,0:30:04.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,啊…
Dialogue: 0,0:30:07.41,0:30:08.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎么了？
Dialogue: 0,0:30:08.77,0:30:10.49,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那个山丘…
Dialogue: 0,0:30:13.37,0:30:15.67,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对了 是那个山丘
Dialogue: 0,0:30:22.47,0:30:23.78,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,露琪亚…
Dialogue: 0,0:30:33.04,0:30:35.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我到底是怎么了…
Dialogue: 0,0:30:37.13,0:30:40.53,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我告诉你了你都不明白吗！
Dialogue: 0,0:30:46.83,0:30:48.25,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,蛇尾丸
Dialogue: 0,0:30:48.65,0:30:51.49,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,为何不使用卍解
Dialogue: 0,0:30:51.68,0:30:53.39,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:30:53.81,0:30:59.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,别装蒜 你的灵魂应该认识我的啊
Dialogue: 0,0:30:59.67,0:31:04.73,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,和我灵魂的交流你也给忘记了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:31:05.02,0:31:07.44,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真没用啊
Dialogue: 0,0:31:07.72,0:31:09.63,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你在说什么呢
Dialogue: 0,0:31:27.86,0:31:30.69,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,白哉大人 白哉大人…
Dialogue: 0,0:31:36.05,0:31:38.69,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,昨天也去流魂街了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:31:39.19,0:31:41.25,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是的 对不起
Dialogue: 0,0:31:41.56,0:31:44.39,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没 不是在责怪你
Dialogue: 0,0:31:44.89,0:31:46.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我是在担心你的身体
Dialogue: 0,0:31:47.31,0:31:50.98,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,白哉大人 但是这次实在是…
Dialogue: 0,0:31:53.01,0:31:54.13,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,绯真！
Dialogue: 0,0:31:54.94,0:31:57.03,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没事的 白哉大人
Dialogue: 0,0:31:57.22,0:31:59.62,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,说什么呢 别勉强啊
Dialogue: 0,0:32:01.77,0:32:05.22,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没 无论如何必须要找到啊
Dialogue: 0,0:32:06.09,0:32:08.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,即使这个身体会怎么样…
Dialogue: 0,0:32:11.35,0:32:14.46,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,找？找什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:32:46.46,0:32:50.39,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,报告 白道门被冲破了
Dialogue: 0,0:32:50.64,0:32:51.92,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是旅祸吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:32:52.08,0:32:52.88,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是的
Dialogue: 0,0:32:53.09,0:32:57.81,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,十番队和志士组成的讨伐队已在追击
Dialogue: 0,0:32:57.99,0:32:58.93,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:33:00.08,0:33:04.79,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但是 为何旅祸会如此熟知此处地形
Dialogue: 0,0:33:16.08,0:33:17.36,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,喂
Dialogue: 0,0:33:17.52,0:33:18.25,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯？
Dialogue: 0,0:33:18.43,0:33:21.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大姐真的曾住过这里吗
Dialogue: 0,0:33:21.53,0:33:24.38,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是啊 据说是这样子
Dialogue: 0,0:33:28.46,0:33:29.52,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯？
Dialogue: 0,0:33:32.45,0:33:35.47,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大姐怎么会在这种地方…
Dialogue: 0,0:33:37.17,0:33:38.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,喂！
Dialogue: 0,0:33:38.34,0:33:40.54,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,啊 是露琪亚
Dialogue: 0,0:33:40.81,0:33:41.89,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,走吧
Dialogue: 0,0:33:56.99,0:34:02.19,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对了 我在这里和伙伴们一起长大…
Dialogue: 0,0:34:03.24,0:34:05.45,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大姐
Dialogue: 0,0:34:07.36,0:34:08.42,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,露琪亚！
Dialogue: 0,0:34:18.81,0:34:20.01,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没事吧
Dialogue: 0,0:34:20.18,0:34:21.36,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大姐
Dialogue: 0,0:34:22.70,0:34:23.88,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们是谁？
Dialogue: 0,0:34:24.12,0:34:25.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大…大姐？
Dialogue: 0,0:34:26.07,0:34:27.61,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你在说什么啊 露琪亚
Dialogue: 0,0:34:27.94,0:34:30.07,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是我啊 露琪亚
Dialogue: 0,0:34:31.61,0:34:32.61,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,死神！
Dialogue: 0,0:34:32.81,0:34:34.37,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,为什么会在这个地方…
Dialogue: 0,0:34:34.94,0:34:36.25,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们是谁？
Dialogue: 0,0:34:41.01,0:34:42.02,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,露琪亚！
Dialogue: 0,0:34:42.20,0:34:43.22,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,退下
Dialogue: 0,0:34:45.79,0:34:47.59,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你到底是谁
Dialogue: 0,0:34:48.03,0:34:49.72,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,为什么知道我的名字
Dialogue: 0,0:34:51.83,0:34:54.78,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我呢？你还记得我吧 大姐
Dialogue: 0,0:34:55.02,0:34:57.07,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,闭嘴 你这个奇怪的生物
Dialogue: 0,0:34:57.29,0:35:00.64,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,奇…奇怪的生物？！
Dialogue: 0,0:35:01.40,0:35:02.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,露琪亚…
Dialogue: 0,0:35:04.68,0:35:06.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真的不记得吗
Dialogue: 0,0:35:07.37,0:35:10.92,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,露琪亚 是我啊 一护啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:35:14.80,0:35:17.44,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你是…啊…
Dialogue: 0,0:35:17.67,0:35:19.06,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,露琪亚 露琪亚
Dialogue: 0,0:35:20.76,0:35:21.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,都是那家伙的错
Dialogue: 0,0:35:21.91,0:35:23.07,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,死神！
Dialogue: 0,0:35:26.65,0:35:29.74,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,喂 你突然要干什么
Dialogue: 0,0:35:31.30,0:35:33.18,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,住手！露琪亚！
Dialogue: 0,0:35:33.42,0:35:35.97,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就这样 把死神什么的都干掉吧
Dialogue: 0,0:35:36.95,0:35:38.32,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,都说了给我住手
Dialogue: 0,0:35:40.94,0:35:42.02,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:35:47.71,0:35:49.85,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,瞬步…不对！
Dialogue: 0,0:35:50.45,0:35:51.98,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们到底是谁
Dialogue: 0,0:35:52.49,0:35:54.03,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你是敌人！
Dialogue: 0,0:35:59.84,0:36:01.49,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,刚才那种感觉到底是什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:36:02.95,0:36:04.77,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,透过了斩月？
Dialogue: 0,0:36:06.62,0:36:08.14,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什么？喂 你！
Dialogue: 0,0:36:10.42,0:36:11.58,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,露琪亚…
Dialogue: 0,0:36:36.16,0:36:37.31,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是谁？
Dialogue: 0,0:36:44.76,0:36:48.21,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,来了一个好久不见的人啊
Dialogue: 0,0:36:49.37,0:36:52.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,还是那么不愉快的脸色
Dialogue: 0,0:36:52.72,0:36:56.58,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,看来还是记得我的事情啊
Dialogue: 0,0:36:56.84,0:36:59.03,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那又怎么样？
Dialogue: 0,0:36:59.32,0:37:04.72,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,该不是为了确认这点事情而来这里的吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:37:04.90,0:37:10.18,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是啊 我是想来调查下你
Dialogue: 0,0:37:10.35,0:37:12.01,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如果我说不呢
Dialogue: 0,0:37:13.21,0:37:14.85,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那就强行…
Dialogue: 0,0:37:17.70,0:37:19.63,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你的记忆发生了错乱
Dialogue: 0,0:37:19.79,0:37:23.14,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,接着我们的记忆中好像也有某人消失了
Dialogue: 0,0:37:23.48,0:37:25.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,说什么呢
Dialogue: 0,0:37:25.51,0:37:28.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我这么想的
Dialogue: 0,0:37:29.77,0:37:36.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你和那个人会不会是遇到了同一个敌人
Dialogue: 0,0:37:36.69,0:37:38.07,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如果是这样的话
Dialogue: 0,0:37:41.43,0:37:43.48,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,知道这个是什么吗
Dialogue: 0,0:37:44.25,0:37:47.77,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,费了好大劲从你的房间里找出来的
Dialogue: 0,0:37:47.99,0:37:52.48,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不过 现在的你估计连这都不记得了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:37:53.75,0:37:54.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯？
Dialogue: 0,0:37:55.02,0:37:59.76,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,开始吧 为了夺回一切
Dialogue: 0,0:38:03.04,0:38:05.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,无论怎么想 这一连串的骚乱
Dialogue: 0,0:38:06.49,0:38:09.67,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,都是刚才那些怪人搞的鬼啊
Dialogue: 0,0:38:10.02,0:38:12.22,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大姐也被抢走了…
Dialogue: 0,0:38:12.50,0:38:16.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可是竟然连大姐都不记得我们
Dialogue: 0,0:38:18.23,0:38:22.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,疼的不是伤口 是心啊
Dialogue: 0,0:38:23.95,0:38:26.21,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,说话啊 喂
Dialogue: 0,0:38:28.05,0:38:29.51,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没辙啊
Dialogue: 0,0:38:30.22,0:38:33.08,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,露琪亚也好 恋次也好都是一样的
Dialogue: 0,0:38:33.26,0:38:35.36,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不在他们的心中
Dialogue: 0,0:38:35.65,0:38:37.26,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,啊…
Dialogue: 0,0:38:38.23,0:38:42.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,虽然总觉得至少露琪亚还是会挂念我…
Dialogue: 0,0:38:42.96,0:38:43.93,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,拍你！
Dialogue: 0,0:38:44.67,0:38:45.30,*Default,,0,0,0,,你
Dialogue: 0,0:38:46.29,0:38:47.96,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我看错你了 一护！
Dialogue: 0,0:38:48.29,0:38:49.76,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,自己一个人消沉什么呢
Dialogue: 0,0:38:49.90,0:38:51.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你是不是脑袋被打坏了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:38:52.22,0:38:55.74,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你在现世也意识到过大姐的危机
Dialogue: 0,0:38:56.55,0:39:01.07,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就算大家都忘了 你也没有忘记过大姐
Dialogue: 0,0:39:01.28,0:39:05.39,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你和大姐还是相连着的啊
Dialogue: 0,0:39:10.12,0:39:13.78,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,切 我一个人也会去救大姐的
Dialogue: 0,0:39:14.05,0:39:18.07,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大姐即使忘记了我 也无所谓的
Dialogue: 0,0:39:20.34,0:39:24.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你就一辈子呆在那儿用你那脑细胞残缺的脑袋思考吧
Dialogue: 0,0:39:35.01,0:39:36.55,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那家伙怎么回事啊
Dialogue: 0,0:39:37.90,0:39:39.52,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没事吗 露琪亚
Dialogue: 0,0:39:40.28,0:39:43.31,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我…认识他
Dialogue: 0,0:39:43.79,0:39:47.13,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是的 我认识那个死神
Dialogue: 0,0:39:47.71,0:39:51.02,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不是一直沉睡着的是吗
Dialogue: 0,0:39:51.57,0:39:53.17,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我之前都在干什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:39:53.39,0:39:55.33,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,为什么我认识那个死神！
Dialogue: 0,0:39:55.57,0:39:56.54,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不知道啊
Dialogue: 0,0:39:56.70,0:39:57.65,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,露琪亚 住手
Dialogue: 0,0:39:57.80,0:39:58.72,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,撒谎！
Dialogue: 0,0:39:59.80,0:40:01.21,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是真的！
Dialogue: 0,0:40:03.91,0:40:08.03,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,因为我们…去了很远的地方…
Dialogue: 0,0:40:08.80,0:40:10.31,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,很远的地方？
Dialogue: 0,0:40:12.49,0:40:14.33,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,终于回来了啊
Dialogue: 0,0:40:15.08,0:40:16.78,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,为了来见露琪亚
Dialogue: 0,0:40:17.55,0:40:19.98,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,经历了百年之久
Dialogue: 0,0:40:20.57,0:40:22.26,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这么久吗
Dialogue: 0,0:40:22.51,0:40:24.84,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,露琪亚 露琪亚
Dialogue: 0,0:40:25.02,0:40:28.08,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,死神这种东西 全都一样
Dialogue: 0,0:40:28.36,0:40:30.06,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是强盗般的存在
Dialogue: 0,0:40:30.54,0:40:34.28,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是啊 那些家伙把什么都夺走了
Dialogue: 0,0:40:34.63,0:40:37.64,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快乐 幸福
Dialogue: 0,0:40:38.21,0:40:39.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,还有露琪亚
Dialogue: 0,0:40:40.56,0:40:41.52,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可是…
Dialogue: 0,0:40:45.62,0:40:47.28,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,露琪亚 怎么了？
Dialogue: 0,0:40:50.03,0:40:51.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,露琪亚 露琪亚
Dialogue: 0,0:40:57.95,0:40:59.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,露琪亚
Dialogue: 0,0:41:00.80,0:41:02.58,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,都是那些家伙的错
Dialogue: 0,0:41:03.07,0:41:04.17,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,姐姐？
Dialogue: 0,0:41:08.00,0:41:09.33,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,死神
Dialogue: 0,0:41:22.15,0:41:23.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你在干嘛啊
Dialogue: 0,0:41:25.48,0:41:27.31,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,喂 别乱看 笨蛋
Dialogue: 0,0:41:27.76,0:41:30.42,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没偷看啦 所以才问的嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:41:31.72,0:41:33.62,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,敬请期待啦
Dialogue: 0,0:41:42.37,0:41:46.33,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,啊 到处在找你
Dialogue: 0,0:41:47.10,0:41:51.62,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你小子什么时候把大姐给我的情书…
Dialogue: 0,0:41:51.85,0:41:56.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真是的 给你这种没毅力的家伙真是浪费了
Dialogue: 0,0:41:56.25,0:41:57.26,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,魂
Dialogue: 0,0:41:58.15,0:41:59.42,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,抱歉
Dialogue: 0,0:41:59.69,0:42:00.93,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,啊？
Dialogue: 0,0:42:01.90,0:42:05.34,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真是的 竟然被你教训了
Dialogue: 0,0:42:06.44,0:42:08.12,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我也还差得远呢
Dialogue: 0,0:42:08.31,0:42:11.72,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什么 混蛋 你得意个什么劲啊
Dialogue: 0,0:42:12.03,0:42:14.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,给我好好振作起来
Dialogue: 0,0:42:14.38,0:42:15.26,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,魂
Dialogue: 0,0:42:15.44,0:42:17.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什…什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:42:17.99,0:42:19.22,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,谢谢了
Dialogue: 0,0:42:19.45,0:42:20.55,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什…
Dialogue: 0,0:42:20.72,0:42:23.48,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,切 明白就好
Dialogue: 0,0:42:23.71,0:42:27.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,本来就是你差点忘了大姐
Dialogue: 0,0:42:27.82,0:42:32.09,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,果然还是我和大姐的羁绊比较深啊
Dialogue: 0,0:42:36.00,0:42:37.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不会再让你逃掉了
Dialogue: 0,0:42:38.11,0:42:40.64,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,束手就擒吧 旅祸们
Dialogue: 0,0:42:44.79,0:42:47.59,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,太小题大做了吧 冬狮郎
Dialogue: 0,0:42:49.24,0:42:50.49,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:42:50.72,0:42:54.15,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你怎么会知道日番谷队长的名字啊？
Dialogue: 0,0:42:54.41,0:42:56.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我当然知道
Dialogue: 0,0:42:57.07,0:42:57.96,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一角
Dialogue: 0,0:42:59.25,0:43:00.47,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,弓亲
Dialogue: 0,0:43:01.16,0:43:05.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不会忘记的 就算你们已经不记得了
Dialogue: 0,0:43:06.01,0:43:08.17,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哈？说什么呢
Dialogue: 0,0:43:08.38,0:43:11.61,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,只不过是旅祸的胡话罢了 一角
Dialogue: 0,0:43:11.83,0:43:14.53,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你是什么人
Dialogue: 0,0:43:15.45,0:43:18.55,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,死神代行 黑崎一护
Dialogue: 0,0:43:18.98,0:43:21.25,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,说是死神代行？
Dialogue: 0,0:43:21.49,0:43:23.28,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那么就把那证据…
Dialogue: 0,0:43:23.46,0:43:24.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,让我看看吧
Dialogue: 0,0:43:41.87,0:43:42.98,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你小子
Dialogue: 0,0:44:04.31,0:44:07.47,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,退下 斑目 让我来
Dialogue: 0,0:44:11.92,0:44:13.73,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,看来如同报告所说
Dialogue: 0,0:44:14.02,0:44:16.73,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你好像知道我们的战斗方式
Dialogue: 0,0:44:17.45,0:44:19.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我再问一遍
Dialogue: 0,0:44:19.32,0:44:21.04,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你是什么人
Dialogue: 0,0:44:21.24,0:44:23.82,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,都说了我是黑崎一护啊
Dialogue: 0,0:44:24.05,0:44:25.61,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,毫无印象
Dialogue: 0,0:44:31.34,0:44:34.29,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,缚道之六十三 锁条锁缚
Dialogue: 0,0:44:44.99,0:44:46.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,咆哮吧 蛇尾丸
Dialogue: 0,0:44:53.67,0:44:54.74,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你…
Dialogue: 0,0:45:06.59,0:45:09.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你想干什么 阿散井
Dialogue: 0,0:45:11.57,0:45:12.79,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,站起来
Dialogue: 0,0:45:13.51,0:45:14.61,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,恋次
Dialogue: 0,0:45:16.25,0:45:17.93,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,别直呼我名字
Dialogue: 0,0:45:18.36,0:45:19.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你是敌人
Dialogue: 0,0:45:20.18,0:45:21.98,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是扰乱静灵庭的旅祸
Dialogue: 0,0:45:22.24,0:45:23.86,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,明明应该是敌人的
Dialogue: 0,0:45:24.60,0:45:25.94,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但是…
Dialogue: 0,0:45:26.41,0:45:29.25,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我并不认为你是敌人
Dialogue: 0,0:45:29.69,0:45:32.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,虽然脑子里明白你是敌人
Dialogue: 0,0:45:32.83,0:45:37.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可我的灵魂告诉我你不是敌人
Dialogue: 0,0:45:38.04,0:45:41.35,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,所以我要遵从我的灵魂
Dialogue: 0,0:45:42.47,0:45:43.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,阿散井
Dialogue: 0,0:45:45.34,0:45:47.42,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,非常抱歉 日番谷队长
Dialogue: 0,0:45:47.70,0:45:49.31,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,请让开
Dialogue: 0,0:46:12.16,0:46:14.45,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,背叛是不可饶恕的
Dialogue: 0,0:46:16.69,0:46:18.25,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,总队长
Dialogue: 0,0:46:21.92,0:46:24.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,必须逮捕旅祸
Dialogue: 0,0:46:34.88,0:46:37.06,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,请听我说 总队长
Dialogue: 0,0:46:37.29,0:46:39.31,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是啊 沟通一下就会明白的
Dialogue: 0,0:46:41.46,0:46:43.28,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不许争辩
Dialogue: 0,0:46:43.85,0:46:45.12,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,抓住他们
Dialogue: 0,0:47:06.99,0:47:07.95,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:47:12.43,0:47:14.47,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你…你小子！
Dialogue: 0,0:47:15.03,0:47:16.38,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那个身形
Dialogue: 0,0:47:19.62,0:47:21.65,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,浦原喜助吗
Dialogue: 0,0:47:22.32,0:47:23.47,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,浦原先生
Dialogue: 0,0:47:23.76,0:47:26.25,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好久不见呢 总队长
Dialogue: 0,0:47:34.49,0:47:35.42,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,看啊
Dialogue: 0,0:47:35.99,0:47:38.59,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,死神们都被抓住了
Dialogue: 0,0:47:39.71,0:47:42.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎么了 不要担心
Dialogue: 0,0:47:42.89,0:47:44.65,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们是无敌的
Dialogue: 0,0:47:46.28,0:47:47.78,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,太过分了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:47:48.85,0:47:50.46,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这样下去 露琪亚她…
Dialogue: 0,0:47:50.63,0:47:53.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,或许永远也想不起我们的名字
Dialogue: 0,0:47:54.65,0:47:55.55,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,姐姐
Dialogue: 0,0:47:55.72,0:47:56.79,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不行
Dialogue: 0,0:47:57.90,0:48:01.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就算这样 也绝不能让她记起那天发生的事
Dialogue: 0,0:48:02.84,0:48:05.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如果那样的话 我们就…
Dialogue: 0,0:48:07.35,0:48:08.84,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你明白的吧
Dialogue: 0,0:48:12.18,0:48:15.32,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没关系 只要死神全灭的话
Dialogue: 0,0:48:15.48,0:48:17.78,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,露琪亚就能永远和我们在一起
Dialogue: 0,0:48:18.66,0:48:21.52,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就算记不起我们的名字也可以
Dialogue: 0,0:48:23.85,0:48:24.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,走吧
Dialogue: 0,0:48:27.17,0:48:29.39,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你为何回来
Dialogue: 0,0:48:29.64,0:48:32.35,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,并非因为没办法了
Dialogue: 0,0:48:33.03,0:48:35.45,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,只是有事想告知
Dialogue: 0,0:48:36.23,0:48:37.84,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有什么事
Dialogue: 0,0:48:38.97,0:48:42.65,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我察觉到了件最重要的事
Dialogue: 0,0:48:43.70,0:48:45.61,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,跟背叛者没什么好说的
Dialogue: 0,0:48:48.27,0:48:50.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,别这么冲动 碎蜂
Dialogue: 0,0:48:51.00,0:48:52.35,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,夜一大人
Dialogue: 0,0:48:52.80,0:48:56.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,汝等是否忘了重要的事
Dialogue: 0,0:48:56.63,0:48:58.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,重要的事指什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:48:58.94,0:49:01.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,最近总是梦寐不安
Dialogue: 0,0:49:02.42,0:49:05.06,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,请务必赐教
Dialogue: 0,0:49:05.77,0:49:07.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你知道什么
Dialogue: 0,0:49:08.27,0:49:10.04,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,所有一切的元凶
Dialogue: 0,0:49:10.46,0:49:12.52,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,元凶？
Dialogue: 0,0:49:12.83,0:49:15.02,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是的 但是在这之前…
Dialogue: 0,0:49:15.35,0:49:16.62,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,黑崎
Dialogue: 0,0:49:17.04,0:49:21.67,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,果然涅和露琪亚被同样的敌人消除了记忆
Dialogue: 0,0:49:22.10,0:49:25.14,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,同样？拿着大镰的二人组吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:49:25.57,0:49:27.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你和他们接触过吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:49:28.07,0:49:30.19,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那么还是快点比较好
Dialogue: 0,0:49:30.74,0:49:32.88,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这里就交给我们了
Dialogue: 0,0:49:33.07,0:49:34.48,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,请去追他们吧
Dialogue: 0,0:49:35.43,0:49:37.02,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,露琪亚有危险
Dialogue: 0,0:49:37.37,0:49:38.33,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,明白了
Dialogue: 0,0:49:38.81,0:49:40.02,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,走吧恋次
Dialogue: 0,0:49:41.45,0:49:44.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我说过 别对我直呼其名
Dialogue: 0,0:49:44.44,0:49:45.57,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,等等
Dialogue: 0,0:49:47.59,0:49:49.98,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大家也隐隐察觉到了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:49:50.37,0:49:52.61,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一种说不出的不协调感
Dialogue: 0,0:49:53.02,0:49:57.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,像忘记了什么重要的东西的那种不安
Dialogue: 0,0:49:59.07,0:50:02.84,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,所以才在静灵庭陷入困难的时候
Dialogue: 0,0:50:03.10,0:50:06.84,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你才会因为一名旅祸来到这里询问
Dialogue: 0,0:50:07.29,0:50:10.32,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,难道不是这样吗 总队长大人
Dialogue: 0,0:50:15.98,0:50:17.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,喂 你…
Dialogue: 0,0:50:17.44,0:50:18.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什么
Dialogue: 0,0:50:18.28,0:50:20.92,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你到底想要干什么
Dialogue: 0,0:50:21.15,0:50:22.59,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,找露琪亚啊
Dialogue: 0,0:50:23.06,0:50:25.86,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,所以说 她是什么人
Dialogue: 0,0:50:26.69,0:50:27.81,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,露琪亚啊
Dialogue: 0,0:50:28.08,0:50:29.88,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你还没有想起来吗
Dialogue: 0,0:50:30.38,0:50:32.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你不是最接近她的人吗
Dialogue: 0,0:50:33.13,0:50:34.77,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,交情最长吧
Dialogue: 0,0:50:35.30,0:50:37.15,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我…吗
Dialogue: 0,0:50:38.86,0:50:41.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那也没办法 记不起来
Dialogue: 0,0:50:41.60,0:50:43.08,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什么没办法啊
Dialogue: 0,0:50:39.55,0:50:40.77,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:50:41.23,0:50:42.79,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:50:43.09,0:50:44.38,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好喝的水啊
Dialogue: 0,0:50:44.60,0:50:45.56,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,干净的水要吗
Dialogue: 0,0:50:45.74,0:50:47.25,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎么了 恋次
Dialogue: 0,0:50:51.34,0:50:53.47,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,把我的水还给我
Dialogue: 0,0:50:53.69,0:50:55.04,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,杀了你
Dialogue: 0,0:50:57.88,0:50:58.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这边
Dialogue: 0,0:51:14.36,0:51:15.52,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,露琪亚…
Dialogue: 0,0:51:15.81,0:51:17.21,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没错 露琪亚
Dialogue: 0,0:51:17.67,0:51:20.22,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,喊一百次二百次就会想起来的
Dialogue: 0,0:51:25.12,0:51:27.04,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有一件事要问你
Dialogue: 0,0:51:28.39,0:51:30.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,为什么不惜做到这种地步也要把她…
Dialogue: 0,0:51:30.97,0:51:32.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,也要救出露琪亚
Dialogue: 0,0:51:34.50,0:51:35.81,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,露琪亚
Dialogue: 0,0:51:36.25,0:51:38.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,她改变了我的世界
Dialogue: 0,0:51:40.79,0:51:44.57,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,为了帮助快死的我和我的家人
Dialogue: 0,0:51:44.89,0:51:47.14,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,分给了我死神的力量
Dialogue: 0,0:51:52.72,0:51:54.31,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,能有现在的我
Dialogue: 0,0:51:55.01,0:51:56.65,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,全都是靠了露琪亚
Dialogue: 0,0:52:03.45,0:52:06.73,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们到底发生了什么事
Dialogue: 0,0:52:06.96,0:52:11.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一句话来说 就是我们的一部分记忆被消除了
Dialogue: 0,0:52:12.93,0:52:15.25,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我按顺序来说明吧
Dialogue: 0,0:52:17.46,0:52:20.55,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我在技术开发局刚设立时
Dialogue: 0,0:52:20.80,0:52:23.49,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有研究某个虚
Dialogue: 0,0:52:24.15,0:52:27.98,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,它可以寄生在魂魄上通过控制其意识来行动
Dialogue: 0,0:52:28.35,0:52:30.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,然后当那个个体衰弱时
Dialogue: 0,0:52:30.78,0:52:33.72,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,又会移到其他个体上
Dialogue: 0,0:52:35.32,0:52:37.62,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但是 最特别之处就是
Dialogue: 0,0:52:37.87,0:52:40.62,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,寄生时能使用像镰刀一样的触手
Dialogue: 0,0:52:40.82,0:52:43.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,夺走对方的记忆
Dialogue: 0,0:52:45.17,0:52:48.22,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如果它从名为朽木露琪亚的死神身上
Dialogue: 0,0:52:48.39,0:52:51.52,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,夺走了身为死神的全部记忆
Dialogue: 0,0:52:51.71,0:52:53.31,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们觉得会怎么样
Dialogue: 0,0:52:53.58,0:52:55.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,笨蛋 那种事情…
Dialogue: 0,0:52:56.08,0:53:01.88,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,确实 它的能力最多寄生在灵力比较弱的魂魄上
Dialogue: 0,0:53:02.17,0:53:05.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,消除记忆的时间也有限
Dialogue: 0,0:53:05.93,0:53:10.69,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,实在想不到能消除一个人本身存在的记忆
Dialogue: 0,0:53:10.96,0:53:12.02,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但是
Dialogue: 0,0:53:12.37,0:53:16.14,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,也就是说还加入了其他的力量
Dialogue: 0,0:53:16.35,0:53:17.44,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,恐怕是的
Dialogue: 0,0:53:17.76,0:53:19.94,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,记忆这种东西是紧密相连的
Dialogue: 0,0:53:20.24,0:53:22.13,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,也可以说是羁绊
Dialogue: 0,0:53:22.34,0:53:23.39,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,所以如果
Dialogue: 0,0:53:23.55,0:53:25.96,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,夺走了一个人全部的记忆
Dialogue: 0,0:53:26.58,0:53:29.13,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,也就是说同时也从周围人的记忆中
Dialogue: 0,0:53:29.32,0:53:33.97,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,消除了关于这个人的全部事情
Dialogue: 0,0:53:34.69,0:53:37.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这次只有一个人是例外
Dialogue: 0,0:53:37.43,0:53:39.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,刚才那个叫黑崎的男人吗
Dialogue: 0,0:53:39.94,0:53:40.72,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是的
Dialogue: 0,0:53:41.00,0:53:45.68,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,黑崎的死神能力原本就是朽木露琪亚的
Dialogue: 0,0:53:45.95,0:53:49.15,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,所以我们也忘记了黑崎的事情
Dialogue: 0,0:53:49.36,0:53:52.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,死神能力的转让吗
Dialogue: 0,0:53:52.41,0:53:54.64,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那种重罪…
Dialogue: 0,0:53:54.97,0:53:56.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,正是如此
Dialogue: 0,0:53:57.03,0:54:00.04,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但是甘心忍受那种罪的恩情
Dialogue: 0,0:54:00.25,0:54:02.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们从黑崎那里接受了
Dialogue: 0,0:54:02.99,0:54:05.89,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们居然都忘记了
Dialogue: 0,0:54:08.26,0:54:12.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,其实我也忘记了他的事
Dialogue: 0,0:54:12.38,0:54:15.69,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,幸好我都存有记录
Dialogue: 0,0:54:15.90,0:54:17.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,才没有误了大事
Dialogue: 0,0:54:17.90,0:54:19.19,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,等一下
Dialogue: 0,0:54:19.49,0:54:21.73,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,涅的事情要怎么说明
Dialogue: 0,0:54:22.01,0:54:24.62,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们还有他的记忆
Dialogue: 0,0:54:24.87,0:54:28.38,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就是那点 我对这点也很在意
Dialogue: 0,0:54:28.61,0:54:32.69,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但是如大家所知涅是个奇怪的人
Dialogue: 0,0:54:33.01,0:54:37.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,或许是他对自己做了什么
Dialogue: 0,0:54:37.63,0:54:39.85,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我这么想着就去调查了下
Dialogue: 0,0:54:40.05,0:54:41.46,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不出所料…
Dialogue: 0,0:54:43.76,0:54:48.42,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,涅平时都有保存自己的记忆备份
Dialogue: 0,0:54:53.38,0:54:54.97,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,总之拜此所赐
Dialogue: 0,0:54:55.22,0:54:58.81,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大家才没有忘记他的事情
Dialogue: 0,0:54:59.41,0:55:01.17,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,再说一次
Dialogue: 0,0:55:02.26,0:55:05.77,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,所有的记忆都是紧密相连的
Dialogue: 0,0:55:12.65,0:55:13.55,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎么样 魂
Dialogue: 0,0:55:13.72,0:55:15.05,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,知道露琪亚的所在处了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:55:15.51,0:55:19.37,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不行 不管怎么说 静灵庭也太大了
Dialogue: 0,0:55:19.74,0:55:23.55,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,只知道大姐之前来过这里
Dialogue: 0,0:55:23.83,0:55:25.67,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可恶  要怎么办才好
Dialogue: 0,0:55:25.95,0:55:27.59,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,线索都没了
Dialogue: 0,0:55:27.77,0:55:28.33,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,喂
Dialogue: 0,0:55:28.50,0:55:29.12,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什么
Dialogue: 0,0:55:29.28,0:55:33.94,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你之前说过你是从露琪亚那里得到死神的能力的吧
Dialogue: 0,0:55:34.11,0:55:35.34,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,啊  没错
Dialogue: 0,0:55:35.52,0:55:37.93,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那么你们的灵质就有可能相似
Dialogue: 0,0:55:38.70,0:55:41.36,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,也就是说你们的灵络或许可以连上
Dialogue: 0,0:55:41.56,0:55:43.77,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,灵络？在这里不行的吧
Dialogue: 0,0:55:43.94,0:55:45.36,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,确实是
Dialogue: 0,0:55:45.59,0:55:47.97,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在由灵子构成的尸魂界
Dialogue: 0,0:55:48.20,0:55:50.45,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,普通情况下视觉化是不可能的
Dialogue: 0,0:55:50.77,0:55:53.25,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但是 如果是灵质相近的你
Dialogue: 0,0:55:53.50,0:55:56.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,或许就能连上露琪亚残留的灵络
Dialogue: 0,0:55:56.76,0:55:58.71,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,虽然我不是很擅长这门鬼道
Dialogue: 0,0:55:59.01,0:56:00.82,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我也尽量帮你 试试看吧
Dialogue: 0,0:56:01.06,0:56:02.22,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,死马当活马医吧
Dialogue: 0,0:56:02.39,0:56:03.39,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,别说蠢话
Dialogue: 0,0:56:03.62,0:56:05.61,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎么能有这么随便的心情呢
Dialogue: 0,0:56:06.05,0:56:07.07,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那家伙…
Dialogue: 0,0:56:07.37,0:56:10.29,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,露琪亚和我是紧密相连的
Dialogue: 0,0:56:10.64,0:56:12.67,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一定要找到她的所在之处
Dialogue: 0,0:56:14.49,0:56:15.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那么开始了
Dialogue: 0,0:57:12.83,0:57:13.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,还能动吗
Dialogue: 0,0:57:20.53,0:57:21.49,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,成功了
Dialogue: 0,0:57:30.71,0:57:31.74,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,等一下
Dialogue: 0,0:57:32.81,0:57:33.88,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,露琪亚
Dialogue: 0,0:57:36.39,0:57:39.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,太好了 头不痛了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:57:40.36,0:57:41.93,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这是什么
Dialogue: 0,0:57:42.74,0:57:44.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这里是…那个…
Dialogue: 0,0:57:45.84,0:57:49.04,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,把让露琪亚痛苦的死神赶出去
Dialogue: 0,0:57:49.81,0:57:51.15,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,把死神…
Dialogue: 0,0:57:53.67,0:57:56.19,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们要用这个…
Dialogue: 0,0:57:56.72,0:58:01.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不行 你考虑过这样会造成多大的伤害吗
Dialogue: 0,0:58:02.09,0:58:04.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,或许静灵庭都会毁灭
Dialogue: 0,0:58:04.40,0:58:05.32,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不是正好吗
Dialogue: 0,0:58:05.60,0:58:07.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,为什么要站在死神那边
Dialogue: 0,0:58:08.63,0:58:12.49,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,死神又会从我们这里夺走露琪亚的
Dialogue: 0,0:58:13.11,0:58:18.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我…我…不要再离开露琪亚了
Dialogue: 0,0:58:18.45,0:58:19.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你在说什么
Dialogue: 0,0:58:20.31,0:58:22.92,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我会一直和你们在一起的
Dialogue: 0,0:58:25.29,0:58:28.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不是骗你的 相信我
Dialogue: 0,0:58:28.29,0:58:30.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不行 绝对不行
Dialogue: 0,0:58:30.95,0:58:32.49,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,必须这么做
Dialogue: 0,0:58:32.84,0:58:34.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,为什么
Dialogue: 0,0:58:34.29,0:58:37.09,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,因为…因为露琪亚…
Dialogue: 0,0:58:56.56,0:58:57.79,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那是什么
Dialogue: 0,0:59:08.54,0:59:12.22,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可恶 虽然不知道是怎么回事但好像开始了呢
Dialogue: 0,0:59:12.39,0:59:12.99,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,露琪亚
Dialogue: 0,0:59:13.17,0:59:14.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,喂
Dialogue: 0,0:59:23.38,0:59:24.15,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,交给我
Dialogue: 0,0:59:24.33,0:59:24.82,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,喂
Dialogue: 0,0:59:24.97,0:59:27.02,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,咆哮吧 蛇尾丸
Dialogue: 0,0:59:33.61,0:59:34.53,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,恋次
Dialogue: 0,0:59:34.96,0:59:37.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,都说了交给我了
Dialogue: 0,0:59:38.30,0:59:39.74,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,卍解
Dialogue: 0,0:59:54.50,0:59:57.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,狒狒王 蛇尾丸
Dialogue: 0,0:59:58.38,1:00:00.54,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你…卍解了
Dialogue: 0,1:00:02.47,1:00:04.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你做什么 多危险啊
Dialogue: 0,1:00:05.22,1:00:06.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你吵死了
Dialogue: 0,1:00:17.95,1:00:21.56,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎么样 蛇尾丸还可以这么用
Dialogue: 0,1:00:21.74,1:00:22.49,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我知道啊
Dialogue: 0,1:00:22.65,1:00:23.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哎
Dialogue: 0,1:00:23.47,1:00:25.78,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,别在意 冲啊
Dialogue: 0,1:00:39.08,1:00:40.14,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,卐解
Dialogue: 0,1:00:48.07,1:00:49.73,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,天锁斩月
Dialogue: 0,1:00:54.79,1:00:55.71,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,露琪亚
Dialogue: 0,1:00:56.06,1:00:57.09,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我没事
Dialogue: 0,1:01:03.06,1:01:04.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎么了
Dialogue: 0,1:01:04.79,1:01:06.79,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,死神 不可以
Dialogue: 0,1:01:14.79,1:01:16.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,死神…
Dialogue: 0,1:01:20.63,1:01:21.62,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什么
Dialogue: 0,1:01:26.26,1:01:27.21,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,啊…
Dialogue: 0,1:01:35.36,1:01:37.69,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,露琪亚 我们来接你了
Dialogue: 0,1:01:37.90,1:01:39.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大姐
Dialogue: 0,1:01:39.30,1:01:40.93,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,她就是露琪亚
Dialogue: 0,1:01:41.17,1:01:42.17,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,啊…
Dialogue: 0,1:01:47.18,1:01:48.42,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,恋次
Dialogue: 0,1:01:54.25,1:01:57.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,滚回去 滚回去 死神
Dialogue: 0,1:01:57.48,1:01:59.89,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,露琪亚根本就不认识你们
Dialogue: 0,1:02:00.14,1:02:01.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎么能就这么走了呢
Dialogue: 0,1:02:01.97,1:02:04.29,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,露琪亚可是我们重要的伙伴啊
Dialogue: 0,1:02:05.15,1:02:07.24,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那并非是露琪亚所希望的
Dialogue: 0,1:02:07.63,1:02:10.51,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,露琪亚已经和你们不一样了
Dialogue: 0,1:02:11.21,1:02:13.14,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,露琪亚 快想起来
Dialogue: 0,1:02:13.43,1:02:16.65,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我所认识的你是不会舍弃死神身份的
Dialogue: 0,1:02:18.05,1:02:21.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,为了救初次相识的我你不惜牺牲性命
Dialogue: 0,1:02:22.63,1:02:24.36,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,为了能让我保护家人
Dialogue: 0,1:02:24.67,1:02:27.46,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你把自己的力量分给了我
Dialogue: 0,1:02:32.37,1:02:34.53,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你是那么坚强的人
Dialogue: 0,1:02:38.93,1:02:39.88,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,露琪亚
Dialogue: 0,1:02:40.86,1:02:42.34,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我…
Dialogue: 0,1:02:42.67,1:02:43.46,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不行
Dialogue: 0,1:02:43.74,1:02:44.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不要啊 露琪亚
Dialogue: 0,1:02:45.31,1:02:46.77,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不要摆出那副表情
Dialogue: 0,1:02:47.61,1:02:48.48,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不要
Dialogue: 0,1:02:48.77,1:02:50.08,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不要啊 露琪亚
Dialogue: 0,1:02:50.52,1:02:52.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不要变回死神
Dialogue: 0,1:02:54.59,1:02:56.56,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,变回死神？
Dialogue: 0,1:02:57.87,1:03:00.18,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我曾经是死神啊
Dialogue: 0,1:03:05.61,1:03:06.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,死神
Dialogue: 0,1:03:07.59,1:03:09.14,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,让我再听一次
Dialogue: 0,1:03:09.85,1:03:10.94,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你的名字
Dialogue: 0,1:03:12.11,1:03:14.14,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,黑崎一护
Dialogue: 0,1:03:14.41,1:03:15.35,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,魂大人
Dialogue: 0,1:03:17.38,1:03:18.68,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,黑崎
Dialogue: 0,1:03:44.51,1:03:45.42,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一护
Dialogue: 0,1:03:49.25,1:03:51.88,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不要
Dialogue: 0,1:03:53.96,1:03:54.93,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,露琪亚
Dialogue: 0,1:03:55.94,1:03:56.85,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不要动
Dialogue: 0,1:03:57.69,1:03:58.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你这家伙
Dialogue: 0,1:04:05.46,1:04:07.15,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不会把露琪亚交给你们
Dialogue: 0,1:04:13.43,1:04:14.51,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,姐姐
Dialogue: 0,1:04:15.47,1:04:17.44,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,绝对不会交给你们
Dialogue: 0,1:04:17.80,1:04:19.55,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,既然这样的话
Dialogue: 0,1:04:21.32,1:04:22.51,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这家伙是怎么回事
Dialogue: 0,1:04:23.80,1:04:26.56,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们就和露琪亚合为一体
Dialogue: 0,1:04:27.04,1:04:29.69,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那样的话露琪亚也会消失
Dialogue: 0,1:04:30.45,1:04:31.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这样也无所谓吗
Dialogue: 0,1:04:35.56,1:04:36.49,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我明白了
Dialogue: 0,1:04:38.95,1:04:41.22,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们会一直在一起
Dialogue: 0,1:04:44.47,1:04:45.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,露琪亚
Dialogue: 0,1:04:46.75,1:04:47.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,露琪亚
Dialogue: 0,1:04:48.95,1:04:50.06,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,露琪亚
Dialogue: 0,1:04:54.50,1:04:55.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,露琪亚
Dialogue: 0,1:04:55.44,1:04:56.37,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大姐
Dialogue: 0,1:05:05.04,1:05:05.97,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,露琪亚
Dialogue: 0,1:05:22.96,1:05:24.32,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,消失吧
Dialogue: 0,1:05:25.14,1:05:26.39,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,所有人
Dialogue: 0,1:05:27.45,1:05:29.39,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,所有人都消失吧
Dialogue: 0,1:05:37.02,1:05:40.25,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这家伙就是把静灵庭弄得乱七八糟的元凶吗
Dialogue: 0,1:05:40.46,1:05:41.57,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,阻止它 恋次
Dialogue: 0,1:05:41.77,1:05:43.96,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那女人由你来想办法
Dialogue: 0,1:05:44.79,1:05:46.96,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你是为此而来的吧
Dialogue: 0,1:05:51.62,1:05:52.76,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,交给我吧
Dialogue: 0,1:06:00.14,1:06:00.96,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,露琪亚
Dialogue: 0,1:06:01.12,1:06:02.24,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大姐
Dialogue: 0,1:06:13.63,1:06:14.49,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,魂
Dialogue: 0,1:06:23.34,1:06:24.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,露琪亚
Dialogue: 0,1:06:52.72,1:06:53.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快去避难
Dialogue: 0,1:06:54.07,1:06:57.33,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,桧佐木副队长 松本副队长 看那个
Dialogue: 0,1:07:10.02,1:07:12.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,啊 这是什么
Dialogue: 0,1:07:27.56,1:07:28.39,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,露琪亚
Dialogue: 0,1:07:47.79,1:07:48.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,除掉
Dialogue: 0,1:07:49.06,1:07:51.08,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没错 除掉
Dialogue: 0,1:08:05.96,1:08:06.98,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,住手
Dialogue: 0,1:08:20.03,1:08:22.82,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,露琪亚 拜托 快醒过来
Dialogue: 0,1:08:23.03,1:08:24.51,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是我 一护啊
Dialogue: 0,1:08:26.50,1:08:28.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快想起来 露琪亚
Dialogue: 0,1:08:43.32,1:08:46.78,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不行 这样下去静灵庭会被吞噬的
Dialogue: 0,1:08:47.00,1:08:48.06,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,松本
Dialogue: 0,1:08:49.01,1:08:49.82,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,队长
Dialogue: 0,1:08:50.00,1:08:51.39,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没事吧 松本
Dialogue: 0,1:08:51.56,1:08:52.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是
Dialogue: 0,1:08:58.51,1:08:59.78,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那是什么
Dialogue: 0,1:08:59.94,1:09:03.62,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哎呀呀呀 又来了个棘手的家伙
Dialogue: 0,1:09:06.60,1:09:08.29,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,按照涅的话说
Dialogue: 0,1:09:08.99,1:09:11.07,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,敌人应该是涅制作的
Dialogue: 0,1:09:11.27,1:09:14.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,灵子聚拢装置的控制片
Dialogue: 0,1:09:15.49,1:09:18.88,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,现在的惨状就是它失控暴走的结果
Dialogue: 0,1:09:19.56,1:09:23.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这么看来不破坏装置的话是无法阻止灵子暴走的了
Dialogue: 0,1:09:24.57,1:09:28.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不过那家伙好象不会轻易让我们通过吧
Dialogue: 0,1:09:30.33,1:09:33.08,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,黒崎他们已经进入内部了
Dialogue: 0,1:09:33.29,1:09:37.13,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们就来阻止灵子在庭内的扩散吧
Dialogue: 0,1:09:37.57,1:09:39.24,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,说的轻巧
Dialogue: 0,1:09:39.41,1:09:41.05,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,以前就是这副样子
Dialogue: 0,1:09:47.40,1:09:52.37,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,万象一切 皆为灰烬 流刃若火
Dialogue: 0,1:09:57.97,1:09:59.71,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不愧是山本老头
Dialogue: 0,1:10:00.11,1:10:02.26,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,各队队长听令
Dialogue: 0,1:10:02.39,1:10:04.56,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一定要阻止灵子的暴走
Dialogue: 0,1:10:04.66,1:10:05.36,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是
Dialogue: 0,1:10:13.15,1:10:15.82,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,所有波流化为吾盾
Dialogue: 0,1:10:15.97,1:10:18.99,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,所有雷光化为吾刃
Dialogue: 0,1:10:19.84,1:10:21.64,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,双鱼理
Dialogue: 0,1:10:22.87,1:10:25.57,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,花风紊乱花神啼
Dialogue: 0,1:10:25.75,1:10:28.37,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,天风紊乱天魔嗤
Dialogue: 0,1:10:29.49,1:10:31.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,花天狂骨
Dialogue: 0,1:10:50.57,1:10:51.69,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,上吧 碎蜂
Dialogue: 0,1:10:51.80,1:10:52.39,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是
Dialogue: 0,1:10:57.32,1:10:58.13,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,瞬开
Dialogue: 0,1:11:15.50,1:11:15.96,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯？
Dialogue: 0,1:11:22.30,1:11:23.17,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,糟了…
Dialogue: 0,1:11:24.65,1:11:25.56,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,碎蜂
Dialogue: 0,1:11:25.93,1:11:27.61,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,鸣叫吧 红姬
Dialogue: 0,1:11:39.68,1:11:41.15,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,夜…夜一大人
Dialogue: 0,1:11:41.25,1:11:41.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯？
Dialogue: 0,1:11:42.04,1:11:44.76,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,万分抱歉 夜一大人…
Dialogue: 0,1:11:49.54,1:11:50.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,算了 算了
Dialogue: 0,1:11:51.35,1:11:52.08,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,走吧
Dialogue: 0,1:11:52.16,1:11:52.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是
Dialogue: 0,1:11:54.12,1:11:55.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,跟上我
Dialogue: 0,1:11:55.24,1:11:56.08,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是
Dialogue: 0,1:11:59.60,1:12:01.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,冰轮丸
Dialogue: 0,1:12:07.68,1:12:09.31,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,低吟吧 灰猫
Dialogue: 0,1:12:13.96,1:12:15.48,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,割除吧 风死
Dialogue: 0,1:12:32.91,1:12:33.63,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,弓亲
Dialogue: 0,1:12:33.90,1:12:35.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,松本 桧佐木
Dialogue: 0,1:12:42.13,1:12:44.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这个硬邦邦的东西 是什么啊
Dialogue: 0,1:12:46.20,1:12:47.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这…这是…
Dialogue: 0,1:13:02.58,1:13:04.86,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,队长
Dialogue: 0,1:13:22.23,1:13:23.37,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是你吗
Dialogue: 0,1:13:23.81,1:13:26.26,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,敢摸我头的家伙
Dialogue: 0,1:13:27.99,1:13:30.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小剑 好啊
Dialogue: 0,1:13:30.44,1:13:33.76,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哼 八千流 别掉下去了哦
Dialogue: 0,1:13:34.62,1:13:36.38,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯嗯
Dialogue: 0,1:13:57.03,1:13:59.68,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可恶 就凭这东西 绝不会让你毁坏这的
Dialogue: 0,1:14:00.96,1:14:02.51,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快停下 露琪亚
Dialogue: 0,1:14:11.62,1:14:16.18,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那个男人 把那个男人的记忆抹掉
Dialogue: 0,1:14:16.78,1:14:20.57,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这样的话 谁也不会再想起露琪亚了
Dialogue: 0,1:14:21.55,1:14:26.63,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对 只有我们才是露琪亚最重要的人
Dialogue: 0,1:14:26.88,1:14:28.06,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,混蛋
Dialogue: 0,1:14:28.81,1:14:31.31,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,记忆并不是全部
Dialogue: 0,1:14:31.47,1:14:34.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,恋次的魂魄 一直记着我
Dialogue: 0,1:14:34.40,1:14:35.79,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,露琪亚也是
Dialogue: 0,1:14:36.59,1:14:40.35,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你不可能夺走我们之间的羁绊
Dialogue: 0,1:14:44.77,1:14:45.62,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,露琪亚
Dialogue: 0,1:14:48.03,1:14:48.89,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可恶
Dialogue: 0,1:14:54.39,1:14:55.35,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,露琪亚
Dialogue: 0,1:15:17.57,1:15:18.22,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,喜助
Dialogue: 0,1:15:18.44,1:15:21.34,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不行啊 太大了
Dialogue: 0,1:15:21.48,1:15:25.52,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,果然还是只有想办法解决研究塔内部的装置了
Dialogue: 0,1:15:25.63,1:15:26.72,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不然是不会有结果的
Dialogue: 0,1:15:26.85,1:15:30.84,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但是 去研究塔的路上却有这家伙挡道
Dialogue: 0,1:15:31.47,1:15:32.21,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什么
Dialogue: 0,1:15:36.35,1:15:37.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,更木
Dialogue: 0,1:15:37.43,1:15:38.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,复活了吗
Dialogue: 0,1:15:38.74,1:15:40.31,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大伙儿 就是现在
Dialogue: 0,1:15:40.48,1:15:42.95,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,虽然辛苦 但还是要躲过那家伙去研究塔…
Dialogue: 0,1:15:43.05,1:15:43.93,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,散开
Dialogue: 0,1:15:44.46,1:15:45.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,千本樱
Dialogue: 0,1:15:49.87,1:15:51.34,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,朽木
Dialogue: 0,1:15:51.47,1:15:53.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,干得不错啊 白哉小子
Dialogue: 0,1:15:54.42,1:15:55.54,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们先走
Dialogue: 0,1:15:55.83,1:15:57.81,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,拜托了 朽木队长
Dialogue: 0,1:16:18.72,1:16:20.79,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大红莲冰轮丸
Dialogue: 0,1:16:24.68,1:16:26.19,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,麻烦了 日番谷队长
Dialogue: 0,1:16:26.28,1:16:28.03,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不用客气了 走吧
Dialogue: 0,1:16:34.30,1:16:35.67,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,龙霰架
Dialogue: 0,1:16:39.14,1:16:41.45,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那我也认真地干一架吧
Dialogue: 0,1:16:47.63,1:16:49.36,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,斩裂 红姬
Dialogue: 0,1:17:04.74,1:17:06.88,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,危险 在后面 一护
Dialogue: 0,1:17:10.66,1:17:12.99,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,缚道之六十一
Dialogue: 0,1:17:13.09,1:17:14.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,六枕光牢
Dialogue: 0,1:17:30.61,1:17:31.79,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,队长
Dialogue: 0,1:17:31.97,1:17:33.09,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,白哉
Dialogue: 0,1:17:34.34,1:17:35.54,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,来者何人
Dialogue: 0,1:17:47.15,1:17:48.12,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,白哉
Dialogue: 0,1:17:48.99,1:17:52.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,卿说的事如果是真的
Dialogue: 0,1:17:52.32,1:17:55.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那这个结局就应由我…
Dialogue: 0,1:18:01.83,1:18:02.94,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,等等
Dialogue: 0,1:18:03.35,1:18:05.31,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,露琪亚还在那里
Dialogue: 0,1:18:05.49,1:18:08.86,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不管变成怎么样 我们都是联系在一起的
Dialogue: 0,1:18:10.94,1:18:12.24,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,露琪亚
Dialogue: 0,1:18:12.38,1:18:14.22,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是这样吧 露琪亚
Dialogue: 0,1:18:22.57,1:18:25.56,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,灵压的虚化还在持续
Dialogue: 0,1:18:25.86,1:18:27.61,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,已经 不可能了…
Dialogue: 0,1:18:27.86,1:18:29.01,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可恶
Dialogue: 0,1:18:30.03,1:18:31.99,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,姐…大姐…
Dialogue: 0,1:18:36.98,1:18:38.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,魂
Dialogue: 0,1:18:38.31,1:18:47.24,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,救…救…大姐…
Dialogue: 0,1:18:49.60,1:18:51.92,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,想要救家人吗
Dialogue: 0,1:18:53.37,1:18:54.92,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,当然啦
Dialogue: 0,1:18:55.72,1:18:57.29,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有办法吗
Dialogue: 0,1:18:58.52,1:19:00.46,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,只有一个方法
Dialogue: 0,1:19:01.48,1:19:03.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就是 你 成为死神
Dialogue: 0,1:19:04.03,1:19:05.05,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,啊
Dialogue: 0,1:19:05.21,1:19:07.44,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不确定行不行
Dialogue: 0,1:19:08.04,1:19:12.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如果失败的话 你和我都会死
Dialogue: 0,1:19:20.52,1:19:24.44,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那家伙 为了保护我和我的家人
Dialogue: 0,1:19:24.63,1:19:26.65,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,牺牲了自己
Dialogue: 0,1:19:26.88,1:19:28.74,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在我身上下了赌注
Dialogue: 0,1:19:30.84,1:19:32.14,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,所以 我也
Dialogue: 0,1:19:32.45,1:19:34.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,绝对不会放弃
Dialogue: 0,1:19:38.30,1:19:40.96,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,卿就按自己的意思办吧
Dialogue: 0,1:19:55.93,1:19:59.39,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,去斩那家伙 杀掉死神
Dialogue: 0,1:20:00.72,1:20:02.25,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我要上了  露琪亚
Dialogue: 0,1:20:03.35,1:20:06.32,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这次轮到我把我的力量分给你了
Dialogue: 0,1:20:17.35,1:20:19.39,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,清醒过来 露琪亚！
Dialogue: 0,1:20:20.34,1:20:21.32,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我是…
Dialogue: 0,1:20:22.55,1:20:24.84,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,黑崎…一护
Dialogue: 0,1:20:32.55,1:20:33.39,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,露琪亚
Dialogue: 0,1:20:34.10,1:20:36.71,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,啊 那个混蛋 在做什么
Dialogue: 0,1:21:18.11,1:21:22.44,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,卍解 千本樱景严
Dialogue: 0,1:21:29.30,1:21:31.52,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,狒骨大炮！
Dialogue: 0,1:21:53.67,1:21:55.94,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,看起来似乎搞定了啊
Dialogue: 0,1:22:06.62,1:22:07.45,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一护
Dialogue: 0,1:22:10.24,1:22:11.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好啊
Dialogue: 0,1:22:22.29,1:22:23.36,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一护
Dialogue: 0,1:22:23.94,1:22:25.08,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快去吧
Dialogue: 0,1:22:29.77,1:22:30.67,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们…
Dialogue: 0,1:22:31.94,1:22:33.72,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,露…琪亚？
Dialogue: 0,1:22:34.09,1:22:35.39,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是露琪亚吗
Dialogue: 0,1:22:35.53,1:22:36.96,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对 是我啊
Dialogue: 0,1:22:37.48,1:22:39.67,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们遭到报应了啊…
Dialogue: 0,1:22:40.34,1:22:44.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,因为没有听露琪亚的话
Dialogue: 0,1:22:44.29,1:22:45.31,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,露琪亚…
Dialogue: 0,1:22:45.94,1:22:48.76,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不要讨厌姐姐啊
Dialogue: 0,1:22:54.88,1:22:56.53,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,救救我 露琪亚
Dialogue: 0,1:22:56.84,1:22:57.71,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在哪里？
Dialogue: 0,1:22:57.95,1:22:59.95,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,露琪亚！
Dialogue: 0,1:23:04.44,1:23:05.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,露琪亚！
Dialogue: 0,1:23:06.34,1:23:07.49,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,死神？
Dialogue: 0,1:23:07.63,1:23:08.49,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,住手！
Dialogue: 0,1:23:16.07,1:23:16.99,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们两个
Dialogue: 0,1:23:17.54,1:23:18.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,露琪亚！
Dialogue: 0,1:23:19.19,1:23:20.02,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没事吧
Dialogue: 0,1:23:20.46,1:23:21.55,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,露琪亚 后面！
Dialogue: 0,1:23:28.87,1:23:30.19,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,露琪亚好棒
Dialogue: 0,1:23:31.08,1:23:31.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,慢着！
Dialogue: 0,1:23:32.77,1:23:34.33,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎么回事 那家伙
Dialogue: 0,1:23:35.15,1:23:36.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,想要…
Dialogue: 0,1:23:36.59,1:23:38.24,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你的灵力…
Dialogue: 0,1:23:38.82,1:23:42.07,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这具身体已经不行了
Dialogue: 0,1:23:42.21,1:23:42.95,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快跑！
Dialogue: 0,1:23:51.52,1:23:54.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你不是死神啊
Dialogue: 0,1:23:54.43,1:23:55.65,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是怪物！
Dialogue: 0,1:24:01.14,1:24:02.32,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,露琪亚！
Dialogue: 0,1:24:09.43,1:24:11.54,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快点放开露琪亚 死神！
Dialogue: 0,1:24:14.28,1:24:15.57,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,别碍事！
Dialogue: 0,1:24:23.68,1:24:24.63,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,姐姐！
Dialogue: 0,1:24:33.43,1:24:34.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是这样啊
Dialogue: 0,1:24:35.77,1:24:40.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可是醒来后 你们两人早就失去踪影了
Dialogue: 0,1:24:41.60,1:24:43.86,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,而我竟然将那件事…
Dialogue: 0,1:24:44.55,1:24:49.26,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那是因为那个虚将你的记忆夺走了的原因吧
Dialogue: 0,1:24:49.56,1:24:51.73,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,另外 还有一点
Dialogue: 0,1:24:51.87,1:24:56.21,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就是这两个人拥有空间转移的特殊能力
Dialogue: 0,1:24:56.63,1:25:01.07,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,恐怕二人是为了临死前能够保护露琪亚
Dialogue: 0,1:25:01.22,1:25:04.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,把虚转到自己的身体里了
Dialogue: 0,1:25:04.56,1:25:08.41,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,虚意识到自己寄生到死人身体里…
Dialogue: 0,1:25:08.52,1:25:10.95,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,十分慌张的逃回虚圈
Dialogue: 0,1:25:11.55,1:25:15.86,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,然而在虚圈 他们夺取了虚的意识
Dialogue: 0,1:25:16.48,1:25:17.63,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,然后
Dialogue: 0,1:25:18.38,1:25:21.81,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,只因被想要见露琪亚这样强烈的思念所驱使
Dialogue: 0,1:25:21.92,1:25:23.53,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,才回来的吧
Dialogue: 0,1:25:25.69,1:25:27.45,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,记起来了啊
Dialogue: 0,1:25:27.75,1:25:30.37,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对不起 我欺骗了你
Dialogue: 0,1:25:31.25,1:25:36.15,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,其实…我们早在那时…就已结束了啊
Dialogue: 0,1:25:36.44,1:25:38.14,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,根本没有结束
Dialogue: 0,1:25:38.31,1:25:41.18,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,死并不代表终结
Dialogue: 0,1:25:42.19,1:25:45.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们不是回来了嘛
Dialogue: 0,1:25:46.20,1:25:47.58,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我好开心
Dialogue: 0,1:25:48.14,1:25:49.95,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我真的好开心啊
Dialogue: 0,1:25:50.83,1:25:53.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,因为好想要见露琪亚啊
Dialogue: 0,1:25:53.92,1:25:56.96,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对我而言 只有露琪亚…
Dialogue: 0,1:25:58.41,1:26:00.52,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你并不是单独一人
Dialogue: 0,1:26:00.65,1:26:06.67,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对你们而言最重要的人不是一直都在身边嘛
Dialogue: 0,1:26:10.63,1:26:13.77,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我记起来了 你们的名字
Dialogue: 0,1:26:15.40,1:26:17.62,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,“炎”和“雫”
Dialogue: 0,1:26:17.89,1:26:21.03,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是关系紧密 互相照耀的存在
Dialogue: 0,1:26:22.03,1:26:23.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,炎…
Dialogue: 0,1:26:23.44,1:26:24.94,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,雫…
Dialogue: 0,1:26:25.32,1:26:27.47,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哇哇 名字！
Dialogue: 0,1:26:27.57,1:26:28.73,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好好听的名字
Dialogue: 0,1:26:30.40,1:26:34.02,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好想听到啊
Dialogue: 0,1:26:34.18,1:26:35.33,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好开心…
Dialogue: 0,1:26:37.13,1:26:38.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,雫
Dialogue: 0,1:26:38.52,1:26:40.32,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,炎姐姐
Dialogue: 0,1:26:42.24,1:26:43.62,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,谢谢…
Dialogue: 0,1:26:47.41,1:26:50.14,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,永别了…露琪亚
Dialogue: 0,1:26:54.27,1:26:56.59,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,炎！雫！
Dialogue: 0,1:26:56.75,1:26:59.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不要死啊 喂…喂！
Dialogue: 0,1:26:59.91,1:27:02.42,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,炎！雫！
Dialogue: 0,1:27:03.51,1:27:07.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,回答我…快回答我！
Dialogue: 0,1:27:38.99,1:27:42.94,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,1:27:41.52,1:27:42.72,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,写的很好吧
Dialogue: 0,1:27:42.86,1:27:46.82,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,照着露琪亚经常画给我们的图画的哦
Dialogue: 0,1:27:52.77,1:27:54.64,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一护 要回去吗
Dialogue: 0,1:27:54.88,1:27:55.77,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是
Dialogue: 0,1:27:56.80,1:27:59.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,又被你救了啊
Dialogue: 0,1:28:00.25,1:28:03.08,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,最初救了我的人是你啊
Dialogue: 0,1:28:07.42,1:28:09.79,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如果说死并不是终结的话
Dialogue: 0,1:28:09.94,1:28:14.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那我们的那次邂逅或许并不是最初的啊
Dialogue: 0,1:28:15.05,1:28:18.53,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,说不定从很早以前 就早已连接在一起了
Dialogue: 0,1:28:20.07,1:28:21.92,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,虽说我并不是很明白
Dialogue: 0,1:28:22.05,1:28:25.24,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但是一旦连接上的羁绊是不会消失的吧
Dialogue: 0,1:28:25.77,1:28:28.82,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那样的话 即使全部忘记
Dialogue: 0,1:28:28.99,1:28:31.07,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,也一定会再次连接上
Dialogue: 0,1:28:32.47,1:28:35.22,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你和那对姐弟也是如此啊
Dialogue: 0,1:28:38.46,1:28:39.64,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是啊
Dialogue: 0,1:28:40.32,1:28:41.46,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,再会啦
Dialogue: 0,1:28:41.57,1:28:43.95,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我先回去了 死神
Dialogue: 0,1:28:44.10,1:28:45.95,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不是死神
Dialogue: 0,1:28:46.11,1:28:48.52,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是朽木露琪亚
Dialogue: 0,1:33:06.85,1:33:10.89,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,喂 有人吗
Dialogue: 0,1:33:11.18,1:33:17.02,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,为什么谁都不来救我啊
Dialogue: 0,1:33:20.58,1:33:25.07,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一护 你应该不会忘记的吧
Dialogue: 0,1:33:25.31,1:33:32.14,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大姐之后是你吗 可恶
Dialogue: 0,1:33:33.28,1:33:36.74,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大姐 大姐…
Dialogue: 0,1:33:36.85,1:33:39.76,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大姐
Dialogue: 0,1:33:40.68,1:33:43.31,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不要抛下我！
Dialogue: 0,1:29:05.51,1:29:08.94,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,∮ 今夜月亮将照亮哪里？ ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:29:09.13,1:29:12.45,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,∮ 浓重的乌云将天空覆盖 ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:29:12.63,1:29:17.88,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,∮ 今夜谁将拥抱着你 ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:29:18.07,1:29:25.39,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,∮ 你还会在雨中独自哭泣吗 ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:29:43.64,1:29:47.07,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,∮ 如果你为自己感到羞愧 ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:29:47.26,1:29:50.57,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,∮ 因为我们对彼此是如此彻底的了解 ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:29:50.70,1:29:54.32,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,∮ 手牵着手我们坐在屋顶上 ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:29:54.45,1:29:58.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,∮ 嘲笑着那个让世界如此悲伤的天空 ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:29:58.39,1:30:05.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,∮ 但是那悲伤却降临在我们身上 ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:30:05.39,1:30:08.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,∮ 你将自己装作一个旅者 ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:30:08.89,1:30:12.26,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,∮ 却迷失在你曾经憎恨的路上 ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:30:12.45,1:30:16.02,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,∮ 蜷缩在避雨的屋檐下 ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:30:16.15,1:30:19.52,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,∮ 你搜寻般的望着这个世界 ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:30:19.71,1:30:26.53,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,∮ 爱的世界没有陪伴在你的身边 ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:30:26.55,1:30:29.93,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,∮ 今夜月亮将照亮哪里？ ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:30:30.11,1:30:33.55,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,∮ 浓重的乌云将天空覆盖 ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:30:33.67,1:30:35.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,∮ 今夜谁将拥抱着你 ∮
